#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "RewriteAddPtrOp"
msgstr "RewriteAddPtrOp"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"分析 `tl.load`, `tl.store`等操作中的指针表达式 "
"(`AddPtrOp`)。将原始的指针偏移计算分解并建模为包含各维度（轴）具体偏移信息的 `PtrState` 对象。例如，对于形如 `ptr + x "
"// 1024 * 4096 + x % 1024 * 4 + y` 的表达式，分析出 `x` 和 `y` 轴的贡献与关系。"
msgstr ""
"Analyzes the pointer expression (`AddPtrOp`) in operations such as `tl.load`"
" and `tl.store`. The original pointer offset calculation is decomposed and "
"modeled into a `PtrState` object containing the specific offset information "
"of each dimension (axis). For example, for an expression like `ptr + x // "
"1024 * 4096 + x % 1024 * 4 + y`, the contributions and relationships of the "
"`x` and `y` axes are analyzed."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"1. 所涉及的原始迭代轴（如`x`）必须能被分裂轴（如`1024`）整除。<br>2. 外部的 `XBLOCK` "
"大小必须是分裂轴`divisor`的整数倍或其约数。"
msgstr ""
"1. The original iteration axis (such as `x`) must be exactly divisible by "
"the split axis (such as `1024`).<br>2. The size of the external `XBLOCK` "
"must be an integer multiple or divisor of the split axis `divisor`."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "CreateAddpr"
msgstr "CreateAddpr"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"根据分析得到的 `PtrState` 对象，重新构造一个新的 `AddPtrOp` 指针计算操作。新生成的指针表达式将消除原表达式中的整数除法 "
"(`//`) 和取模 (`%`) 操作。"
msgstr ""
"Reconstructs a new `AddPtrOp` pointer calculation operation based on the "
"analyzed `PtrState` object to eliminate the integer division (`//`) and "
"modulo (`%`) operations in the original expression."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "依赖于 `RewriteAddPtrOp` 成功生成的、合法的 `PtrState`。"
msgstr ""
"It depends on the valid `PtrState` object successfully generated by "
"`RewriteAddPtrOp`."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "RewriteLoadOp"
msgstr "RewriteLoadOp"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"分析 `tl.load` 操作中的掩码 (`mask`) 表达式。将包含整除/取余的复杂掩码条件分解并建模为包含各维度边界信息的 `MaskState`"
" 对象。例如，对于 `mask = x // 1024 < 8 and x % 1024 < 1024 and y < "
"4`，分析出各维度的独立约束条件。"
msgstr ""
"Analyzes the `mask` expression in the `tl.load` operation. Decomposes and "
"models complex mask conditions involving integer division and modulo into a "
"`MaskState` object containing boundary information for each dimension. For "
"example, for `mask = x // 1024 < 8 and x % 1024 < 1024 and y < 4`, "
"independent constraint conditions for each dimension are analyzed."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "BuildMask"
msgstr "BuildMask"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"根据分析得到的 `MaskState` 对象，重新构造一个新的掩码 (`mask`) 表达式。新掩码将消除原表达式中的整数除法 (`//`) 和取模 "
"(`%`) 操作。"
msgstr ""
"Reconstructs a new `mask` expression based on the analyzed `MaskState` "
"object to eliminate the integer division (`//`) and modulo (`%`) operations "
"in the original expression."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"仅处理由 `RewriteLoadOp` 或 `RewriteStoreOp` 生成的 "
"`MaskState`。无法处理任意复杂的、非规范化的掩码表达式。"
msgstr ""
"Only processes the `MaskState` generated by `RewriteLoadOp` or "
"`RewriteStoreOp`. Cannot handle arbitrarily complex or non-standardized mask"
" expressions."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "CreateLoad"
msgstr "CreateLoad"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"使用由 `CreateAddpr` 生成的新指针表达式和由 `BuildMask` 生成的新掩码表达式，重新创建（替换）原始的 `tl.load` "
"操作，完成指令重写。"
msgstr ""
"Re-creates/Replaces the original `tl.load` operation using the new pointer "
"expression generated by `CreateAddPtr` and the new mask expression generated"
" by `BuildMask` to complete the instruction rewrite."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"依赖于 `RewriteAddPtrOp`, `CreateAddpr`, `RewriteLoadOp`, `BuildMask` "
"等前置步骤均成功执行。"
msgstr ""
"The prerequisite steps, such as `RewriteAddPtrOp`, `CreateAddPtr`, "
"`RewriteLoadOp`, `BuildMask`, must be successfully executed."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "RewriteStoreOp"
msgstr "RewriteStoreOp"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"分析 `tl.store` 操作中的掩码 (`mask`) 表达式。其功能与 `RewriteLoadOp` "
"类似，将包含整除/取余的复杂掩码条件分解并建模为 `MaskState` 对象。"
msgstr ""
"Analyzes the `mask` expression in the `tl.store` operation. Its function is "
"similar to `RewriteLoadOp`, decomposing and modeling complex mask conditions"
" involving integer division and modulo into a `MaskState` object."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "与 `RewriteLoadOp` 相同。"
msgstr "Same as `RewriteLoadOp`."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "CreateStore"
msgstr "CreateStore"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"使用由 `CreateAddpr` 生成的新指针表达式和由 `BuildMask` 生成的新掩码表达式，重新创建（替换）原始的 `tl.store` "
"操作，完成指令重写。"
msgstr ""
"Re-creates/Replaces the original `tl.store` operation using the new pointer "
"expression generated by `CreateAddPtr` and the new mask expression generated"
" by `BuildMask` to complete the instruction rewrite."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"依赖于 `RewriteAddPtrOp`, `CreateAddpr`, `RewriteStoreOp`, `BuildMask` "
"等前置步骤均成功执行。"
msgstr "ttir->linalgir"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "RewriteAtomicRWMOp"
msgstr "RewriteAtomicRWMOp"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "处理原子读写修改操作（如 `atomic.add`, `atomic.max` 等）中的指针问题。"
msgstr ""
"Handles pointer issues in atomic read/write/modify operations (such as "
"`atomic.add` and `atomic.max`)."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "通常继承与 `RewriteAddPtrOp` 相同的局限性。对于某些特殊的、非连续或条件性的原子操作模式可能不支持。"
msgstr ""
"Generally inherits the same limitations as `RewriteAddPtrOp`. Some special, "
"non-contiguous, or conditional atomic operation patterns may not be "
"supported."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "RewriteAtomicCASOp"
msgstr "RewriteAtomicCASOp"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"处理原子比较并交换操作 (`atomic.cas`) "
"中的指针线性化问题。分析其指针表达式，通过升维方法消除整除和取余操作，以匹配硬件原子指令的寻址要求。"
msgstr ""
"Handles pointer linearization issues in atomic compare-and-swap operations "
"(`atomic.cas`). Analyzes the pointer expression and eliminates integer "
"division and modulo operations through tensorization to meet the addressing "
"requirements of hardware atomic instructions."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "RewriteWhile"
msgstr "RewriteWhile"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "处理 `while` 循环体内的指针叠加操作。"
msgstr "Handles pointer overlapping operations in the `while` loop body."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "不支持循环体内包含条件分支 (`if`) 的复杂指针路径变换。"
msgstr ""
"Complex pointer path transformations containing conditional branches (`if`) "
"in the loop body are not supported."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "RewriteFor"
msgstr "RewriteFor"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "处理 `for` 循环体内的指针叠加操作。"
msgstr "Handles pointer overlapping operations in the `for` loop body."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:125
msgid "3.2.2.2 TritonToUnstructured"
msgstr "3.2.2.2 TritonToUnstructured"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "Pass / 转换器"
msgstr "Pass/Converter"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "discrete-mask-access-conversion"
msgstr "discrete-mask-access-conversion"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"将Triton中基于离散索引掩码（Discrete "
"Mask）的内存访问模式（如`triton.language.load`带非连续mask）进行分析与转换，为后续将离散轴展开为循环做准备。该Pass识别出那些无法被后端硬件高效处理的、非规律性的或稀疏的访问模式。"
msgstr ""
"Analyzes and converts the memory access pattern based on the discrete index "
"mask in Triton (for example, `triton.language.load` with a non-contiguous "
"mask) to prepare for the subsequent expansion of discrete axes into loops. "
"This pass identifies irregular or sparse access patterns that cannot be "
"efficiently processed by the backend hardware."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"将经过`discrete-mask-access-conversion`识别出的、包含离散轴（Discrete "
"Axes）的张量操作，转换为基于显式标量循环的标量访存。"
msgstr ""
"Converts the tensor operations identified by `discrete-mask-access-"
"conversion` and containing discrete axes into scalar memory access based on "
"explicit scalar loops."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "bubble-up-operation"
msgstr "bubble-up-operation"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"主要对`extract "
"op/extract_slice`顺序上移优化。这可以优化数据局部性，有些场景能消除转换后产生的不必要的循环，从而提升生成代码的执行效率。"
msgstr ""
"Bubbles up `extract op/extract_slice` for optimization. This optimizes data "
"locality. In some scenarios, unnecessary loops generated after "
"transformation can be eliminated, thereby improving the execution efficiency"
" of the generated code."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:133
msgid "3.2.2.2.1 discrete-mask-access-conversion"
msgstr "3.2.2.2.1 discrete-mask-access-conversion"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "转换器名称"
msgstr "Converter Name"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "DiscreteMaskStoreConversion"
msgstr "DiscreteMaskStoreConversion"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"首先进行mask分析，如果mask分析结果是非连续的，将原始的store操作转化为以下序列：<br>1. load（加载目标存储地址的内容）<br>2."
" select（根据mask挑选目标存储内容和待存储的value内容）<br>3. store（将select的结果存储回目标地址）"
msgstr ""
"Analyzes the mask and converts the original store operation into the "
"following sequence if it is non-contiguous:<br>1. load (load the content at "
"the target address)<br>2. select (select the target content and the value to"
" be stored based on the mask)<br>3. store (store the select result back to "
"the target address)"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "DiscreteMaskLoadConversion"
msgstr "DiscreteMaskLoadConversion"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"首先进行mask分析，如果mask分析结果是非连续的，将原始的load操作转化为以下序列：<br>1. "
"load（加载源tensor的所有内容）<br>2. select（根据mask挑选源tensor内容，被掩盖部分设置为other值）"
msgstr ""
"Analyzes the mask and converts the original load operation into the "
"following sequence if it is non-contiguous:<br>1. load (load all content of "
"the source tensor)<br>2. select (select the source tensor content based on "
"the mask, setting the masked part to the other value)"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "DiscreteMaskAtomicAddConversion"
msgstr "DiscreteMaskAtomicAddConversion"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"首先进行mask分析，如果mask分析结果是非连续的，将原始的atomic_add操作转化为以下序列：<br>1. "
"select（根据mask挑选value的值，被掩盖部分设为0）<br>2. "
"atomic_add（使用select后的结果重新生成atomic_add操作）"
msgstr ""
"Analyzes the mask and converts the original atomic_add operation into the "
"following sequence if it is non-contiguous:<br>1. select (select the value "
"based on the mask, setting the masked part to 0)<br>2. atomic_add "
"(regenerate the atomic_add operation using the select result)"

