#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "triton-to-annotation"
msgstr "triton-to-annotation"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"处理Ascend NPU特有的编译提示指令 "
"(`tl.compile_hint`)，将其转换为后端的Annotation方言，用于指导后续的硬件特定优化或资源配置。"
msgstr ""
"Processes Ascend NPU-specific compilation hint instructions "
"(`tl.compile_hint`), converting them into the backend Annotation dialect to "
"guide subsequent hardware-specific optimization or resource configuration."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "TritonAnnotationConversion"
msgstr "TritonAnnotationConversion"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"将 `triton::AnnotationOp` 转换为 `annotation::MarkOp`，实现高级编译提示信息向底层注释标记的传递。"
msgstr ""
"Converts `triton::AnnotationOp` to `annotation::MarkOp`, enabling the "
"transfer of high-level compilation hints to underlying annotation markers."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "triton-to-hfusion"
msgstr "triton-to-hfusion"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "将Triton中的`TTIR`转换为Ascend NPU硬件加速器`HFusion`方言中的对应操作"
msgstr ""
"Converts `TTIR` in Triton to corresponding operations in the Ascend NPU "
"hardware accelerator `HFusion` dialect."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "TritonHistogramToHFusionConversion"
msgstr "TritonHistogramToHFusionConversion"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "将 `triton::HistogramOp` 转换为 `hfusion::HistogramOp`，使能在NPU的专用硬件上高效执行。"
msgstr ""
"Converts `triton::HistogramOp` to `hfusion::HistogramOp`, enabling efficient"
" execution on dedicated NPU hardware."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "triton-to-hivm"
msgstr "triton-to-hivm"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"处理Triton的块同步操作 (`tl.sync_block_all`, `tl.sync_block_set`, "
"`tl.sync_block_wait`)，将其转换为Ascend "
"NPU的`HIVM`方言中的跨核心同步指令。这些指令用于管理多核流水线中的同步与数据依赖，是流水优化的关键。"
msgstr ""
"Processes Triton's block synchronization operations (`tl.sync_block_all`, "
"`tl.sync_block_set`, `tl.sync_block_wait`), converting them into cross-core "
"synchronization instructions in the Ascend NPU `HIVM` dialect. These "
"instructions manage synchronization and data dependencies in multi-core "
"pipelines and are key to pipeline optimization."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "TritonCustomOpToHIVMSyncOpConversion"
msgstr "TritonCustomOpToHIVMSyncOpConversion"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"实现Triton同步指令到HIVM同步指令的转换：<br>• `sync_block_all`：全局块同步<br>• "
"`sync_block_set`：设置同步点<br>• `sync_block_wait`：等待同步点"
msgstr ""
"Converts Triton synchronization instructions to HIVM synchronization "
"instructions:<br>• `sync_block_all`: Global block synchronization<br>• "
"`sync_block_set`: Set synchronization point<br>• `sync_block_wait`: Wait for"
" synchronization point"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "triton-to-llvm"
msgstr "triton-to-llvm"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"将Triton中的内联汇编操作 (`tl.inline_assembly`) 转换为LLVM方言的内联汇编，并最终映射为Ascend "
"NPU的CCE硬件固有函数（Intrinsics）"
msgstr ""
"Converts Triton's inline assembly operations (`tl.inline_assembly`) to LLVM "
"dialect inline assembly, ultimately mapping to Ascend NPU CCE hardware "
"intrinsics."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "ElementwiseInlineAsmOpConversion"
msgstr "ElementwiseInlineAsmOpConversion"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "将 `triton::ElementwiseInlineAsmOp` 转换为 `LLVM::InlineAsmOp`"
msgstr "Converts `triton::ElementwiseInlineAsmOp` to `LLVM::InlineAsmOp`."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:215
msgid "3.2.3 Ascend affinitive Operators"
msgstr "3.2.3 Ascend affinitive Operators"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "Operator"
msgstr "Operator"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "tl.custom_op"
msgstr "tl.custom_op"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"Ascend NPU扩展的自定义算子集，用于支持硬件特定的内存访问与数据搬运模式，例如：<br>• `index_select`: "
"基于索引选择数据<br>• `index_put`: 基于索引放置数据<br>• `gather_out_to_ub`: 将外部数据收集到Unified"
" Buffer (UB)<br>• `scatter_ub_to_out`: 将UB中的数据分散输出<br>• `indirect_load`: "
"间接地址加载<br>• `indirect_store`: 间接地址存储"
msgstr ""
"A custom operator set extended for Ascend NPU to support hardware-specific "
"memory access and data movement patterns, such as:<br>• `index_select`: "
"Select data based on index<br>• `index_put`: Place data based on index<br>• "
"`gather_out_to_ub`: Gather external data to Unified Buffer (UB)<br>• "
"`scatter_ub_to_out`: Scatter data from UB to output<br>• `indirect_load`: "
"Indirect address loading<br>• `indirect_store`: Indirect address storage"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "tl.compile_hint"
msgstr "tl.compile_hint"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "向编译器传递硬件特定的编译提示信息，用于指导后端优化策略、资源分配或内核配置。"
msgstr ""
"Passes hardware-specific compilation hints to the compiler to guide backend "
"optimization strategies, resource allocation, or kernel configuration."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "tl.sync_block_wait(`sender, receiver, event_id`)"
msgstr "tl.sync_block_wait(`sender, receiver, event_id`)"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"块同步等待操作。指定接收核 (`receiver`) 等待由发送核 (`sender`) 发出的事件信号 "
"(`event_id`)，用于管理跨核流水线中的数据依赖与执行顺序。"
msgstr ""
"Block synchronization wait operation. Specifies that the receiver core "
"(`receiver`) waits for the event signal (`event_id`) sent by the sender core"
" (`sender`), used to manage data dependencies and execution order in cross-"
"core pipelines."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "tl.sync_block_set(`sender, receiver, event_id`)"
msgstr "tl.sync_block_set(`sender, receiver, event_id`)"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"块同步设置操作。指定发送核 (`sender`) 向接收核 (`receiver`) 发出一个事件信号 "
"(`event_id`)，表明某个执行阶段或数据已准备就绪。"
msgstr ""
"Block synchronization set operation. Specifies that the sender core "
"(`sender`) sends an event signal (`event_id`) to the receiver core "
"(`receiver`), indicating that a certain execution phase or data is ready."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid "tl.sync_block_all(`mode, event_id`)"
msgstr "tl.sync_block_all(`mode, event_id`)"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md
msgid ""
"全局块同步操作。根据指定的同步模式 (`mode`)，向所有相关的接收核广播一个事件信号 "
"(`event_id`)，用于实现全核同步或特定模式的集体同步。"
msgstr ""
"Global block synchronization operation. Broadcasts an event signal "
"(`event_id`) to all relevant receiver cores according to the specified "
"synchronization mode (`mode`), used to achieve full-core synchronization or "
"mode-specific collective synchronization."
